<div>
    <p>Dear {{data.tlName}},</p>

    <p>The bid has been submitted for {{data.tenderName}}.</p>

    {{#if data.document_urls.length}}
        <p>Bidding documents:</p>
        <ul>
            {{#each data.document_urls}}
                <li><a href="{{this.url}}" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;">{{this.name}}</a></li>
            {{/each}}
        </ul>
    {{/if}}

    {{#if data.submission_proof_url}}
        <p>Proof of Tender Submission: <a href="{{data.submission_proof_url}}" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;">Open</a></p>
    {{/if}}

    {{#if data.final_price_url}}
        <p>Final Price Screenshot: <a href="{{data.final_price_url}}" target="_blank" style="color: #0066cc; text-decoration: underline;">Open</a></p>
    {{/if}}

    <p>The tender due date and time was {{data.dueDate}}</p>
    <p>The bidding date and time was {{data.bidSubmissionDate}}.</p>
    <p>We submitted the bid {{data.timeBeforeDeadline}} before the bid submission deadline.</p>

    <p>"We leverage our team work to create results."</p>

    <p>Best Regards,<br />
        {{data.teName}}</p>

</div>
